    "placeholder": "Enter your reflection here.",
    "long_instructions": "# Generative AI in Coding: Real-World Impact & Examples\r\n\r\n#### Generative AI can help write, fix, and improve code. Instead of starting from scratch, coders can describe what they want in plain language, and AI suggests code that can be used, adapted, or improved.\r\n\r\n\r\n## How it’s used in the real world:\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; max-width: 1200px; margin: auto;\">\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f2f4f7; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; align-items: center;\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://emojiapi.dev/api/v1/light_bulb/128.png\" alt=\"Light Bulb Emoji\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.3; width: 100%;\">AI Code Autocompletion</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; width: 100%;\">Acts like an “autocomplete” for code, suggesting lines or whole functions as you type.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f2f4f7; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; align-items: center;\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://emojiapi.dev/api/v1/magnifying_glass_tilted_left/128.png\" alt=\"Magnifying Glass Emoji\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.3; width: 100%;\">AI Debugging</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; width: 100%;\">Developers use AI to spot errors and recommend fixes, turning debugging into a faster, more collaborative process.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f2f4f7; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; align-items: center;\">\r\n <p style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 2.5rem\">🌐\r\n \r\n </p>\r\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.3; width: 100%;\">Website Builders</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; width: 100%;\">Some tools let you describe a website in words, and AI creates the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to make it real.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f2f4f7; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; align-items: center;\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://emojiapi.dev/api/v1/clipboard/128.png\" alt=\"Clipboard Emoji\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.3; width: 100%;\">Code Review Helpers</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; width: 100%;\">AI can suggest improvements, check for bugs, or explain tricky parts of code.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Why it matters for students:\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Learning to code with AI mirrors how real developers now work. Students get practice thinking through logic and design while learning to critically evaluate AI’s help—building skills that are both creative and future-ready. \r\n\r\n## Reflect\r\n#### Take a moment to gather your thoughts on what you have read so far and reflect on the following:\r\n\r\n>#### With generative AI becoming part of how real developers work, how do you feel about adjusting your teaching to include these new tools and ideas? What challenges do you anticipate, and what excites you most about helping students learn coding in this future-facing way?",
